["<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Sara Weiss’s Journeys to the Planet Mars canali automatic writing Ento\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-stuffmissed-灵媒笔下的火星语言-代词和十进制都和英语一模一样/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">39:45</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>灵媒笔下的火星语言：代词和十进制都和英语一模一样</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Sarah Weiss 自称1892到1894年魂游火星两年写成近600页记录，但事后调查者发现书中火星语的代词系统和十进制计数都与英语高度雷同，这让整件事更像创作而非真实的星际接触。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">火星</span><span class=\"tag\">灵媒</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Addiction, Faith, and the Limits of Willpower (with Meghan O&#x27;Gieblyn) akrasia ego depletion theory theodicy 12-step program\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-econtalk-戒酒11年后又偷偷喝了一年-意志力根本靠不住/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/f8da698e33560635-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:09:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">EconTalk</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>戒酒11年后又偷偷喝了一年：意志力根本靠不住</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">薇依认为，改掉恶习靠的是专注而不是意志——这正是作者戒酒十一年后仍秘密复饮一年、而非被意志力拯救的原因。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">成瘾</span><span class=\"tag\">意志力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Top 100 Consumer AI Apps: Who’s Actually Paying? harness / shim PLG (product-led growth) run rate power law\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-a16z-付费ai用户不到5-最大金主每月刷卡903美元/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">51:04</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>付费AI用户不到5%,最大金主每月刷卡903美元</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">全美只有4.5%的人为AI产品付费，但这其中最顶端的1%人均每月刷卡903美元——消费级AI的真实生意，是极少数重度用户撑起来的。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">消费AI</span><span class=\"tag\">付费订阅</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"Compute Is A Trillion-Dollar Market Trading In Group Chats | Brett Harrison &amp; Andrawes Bahou offtake agreement phantom capacity neocloud DCM(Designated Contract Market) node\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-empire-万亿美元的算力交易-现在还靠短信和电话撮合/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/9d284fe9c89109a3-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"E\"><span class=\"dur\">1:05:37</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Empire（Blockworks）</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>万亿美元的算力交易，现在还靠短信和电话撮合</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">算力合约单笔高达百亿美元，却没有统一报价和对冲工具，买卖双方至今靠人脉、电话和短信私下议价成交。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">算力</span><span class=\"tag\">衍生品</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"Jon Ronson: men unravelling masking unalive pre-spend\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-startweek-旧有制度正在崩塌-科技公司顺势放大人的失控一面/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/8fc04a8d1e9204fb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">41:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">Start the Week</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>旧有制度正在崩塌，科技公司顺势放大人的失控一面</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Jon Ronson发现，当工作与身份的旧秩序瓦解，人们转而建城堡、扮网红、向AI求夸奖来找回目的感，而科技公司正靠放大这种疯狂变现。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">网红经济</span><span class=\"tag\">消费主义</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Why Treasuries Are &#x27;Risky&#x27; Again policy reaction function TIPS forward guidance Ricardian equivalence bond-stock co-movement\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-oddlots-美债收益率暴涨背后-国债正变得像股票一样危险/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/dbb9160e6d589beb-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">50:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Odd Lots</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>美债收益率暴涨背后：国债正变得像股票一样危险</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">过去五年美债收益率的上涨，大部分并非通胀预期推高，而是美债和股票的相关性由负转正，投资者要求更高风险补偿的结果。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>9</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">美债</span><span class=\"tag\">美联储</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"10 Years of How I Built This: A Decade of Innovation, Risk and Reinvention pencils down light bulb moment cash incinerator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-howibuilt-原来-吓人-和-危险-是两回事-真正要命的从不吓人/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/aedd4aae43a50f3c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">1:10:20</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">How I Built This</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>原来「吓人」和「危险」是两回事：真正要命的从不吓人</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">留在一份不喜欢的稳定工作里不吓人，但真正危险；辞职创业很吓人，却有安全绳兜底——这是贯穿全集、被反复验证的判断标准。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">创业</span><span class=\"tag\">融资</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"The Yakuza ninkyo oyabun kobun ronin Daini Ponsegidan\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-historyhit-一位大阪黑帮老大假扮外交使节-赴柏林拜会希姆莱/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ed650dd95a0aece2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"D\"><span class=\"dur\">49:02</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">History Hit</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>一位大阪黑帮老大假扮外交使节，赴柏林拜会希姆莱</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这趟欧洲行程是大阪黑帮老大为躲避日本国内扫黑行动而精心策划的公关秀，他本人统领的准军事组织成员超过十万人。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">日本黑帮</span><span class=\"tag\">德川幕府</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"parent\" data-hay=\"RE-RELEASE: What’s Really Behind Your Hardest Parenting Days non-cognitive shift AccountaBuddies Internal Family Systems (IFS) temperament mismatch\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-parentmojo-焦虑-抑郁-adhd-酗酒-也许都是同一种-需求没被满足/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70c340acb32275d2-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"Y\"><span class=\"dur\">40:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"parent\"><span class=\"src\">Your Parenting Mojo</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>焦虑、抑郁、ADHD、酗酒：也许都是同一种「需求没被满足」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">主持人认为抑郁、焦虑、酗酒、ADHD背后可能是同一个根源——长期未被满足的需求；诊断只是社会在说「你没达到我们的期待」。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">育儿</span><span class=\"tag\">情绪触发</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"899: Reaching Out\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-05-tal-两兄弟查到生父地址-他开的理发店离自己五分钟车程/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/270b648bd10b4e9a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:02:05</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">This American Life</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1005</span></div>\n<h2>两兄弟查到生父地址：他开的理发店离自己五分钟车程</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">一对双胞胎靠一份被遗忘的DNA检测拼出生父姓名，发现他就在五分钟车程外开理发店，却足足等了近一年才敢推门进去，连对峙完是否真能「了结」都没把握。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">纪录片播客</span><span class=\"tag\">寻亲</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-hay=\"E202 中国运动品牌四十年：李宁 vs 安踏 | 永庆对话《鞋帮》作者黄子懿 DTC Flyknit ERP/POS\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-touzishizhan-李宁换标只换了logo-代言人却找了生于70年代的林志玲/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6bbc364a8900ce91-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"投\"><span class=\"dur\">2:15:48</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">投资实战派</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>李宁换标只换了logo,代言人却找了生于70年代的林志玲</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">李宁想靠换标做「90后李宁」的年轻化，却只换了logo没同步换产品，代言人林志玲比目标消费者整整大了一代，换标很快失速。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">运动品牌</span><span class=\"tag\">渠道变革</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"The Fall of Brazil&#x27;s Armored Vehicle King preventive Concordata Boomerang system hydropneumatic suspension\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-asianometry-押注坦克豪赌沙特大单-巴西军火大王却沦为谈判筹码/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3b8c4deb16ae26ff-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"A\"><span class=\"dur\">29:32</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Asianometry</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>押注坦克豪赌沙特大单，巴西军火大王却沦为谈判筹码</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">沙特借巴西奥索里奥坦克的报价向美国通用动力压价，拿到更优条件后转头签下31亿美元订单，押上全部家当的救命合同落空，巴西军火巨头两年后申请破产保护。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>5</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">军工产业</span><span class=\"tag\">地缘政治</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"OpenAI’s Head of ChatGPT: We’re entering a new era of AI (again) | Tibo Sottiaux Dots MCP harness prompt injection Astra\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-lennys-openai要砍掉模型选择器-以后只跟一个常驻agent说话/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/70510fabe7e8afc9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"L\"><span class=\"dur\">37:23</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">Lenny&#x27;s Podcast</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>OpenAI要砍掉模型选择器：以后只跟一个常驻agent说话</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">OpenAI正把Codex、ChatGPT和Dots合并成一个没有模型选择器的常驻智能体，目标是用户不用再选模型、不用再开多少个agent，直接说出要做的事。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">Dots</span><span class=\"tag\">OpenAI</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"David George &amp; Jack Altman on AI, Autonomy, and the Next $25 Trillion skeuomorphic blast radius model busters harness\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-a16z-ai行业全部收入几乎来自3000万程序员-15亿知识工作者才刚起步/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">55:03</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>AI行业全部收入几乎来自3000万程序员，15亿知识工作者才刚起步</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">这轮AI收入几乎全靠3000万程序员这类重度用户撑起来，企业渗透率不到5%,一旦扩散到15亿知识工作者，规模还会再涨几十倍。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">企业AI</span><span class=\"tag\">自动驾驶</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Vol.285｜从一颗荔枝到一个餐馆：四部影视剧里的中国｜主播：施展 mission impossible\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-cn27f438-北方草原南下不是野蛮赢文明-是有组织赢无组织/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7d46bbafb24c11f4-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"东\"><span class=\"dur\">1:18:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">东腔西调</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>北方草原南下不是野蛮赢文明，是有组织赢无组织</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">草原武力几百年打不过中原，真正让它取得碾压优势的，是中原官僚系统先把自己耗成了一盘散沙。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">历史周期律</span><span class=\"tag\">官僚系统</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"TWiV 1363: A Cauldron of Bats Anthropocene Bayesian geospatial logistic regression virus-interacting proteins (VIPs) haplotype-resolved genome assembly PKR (protein kinase R) antagonistic/agonistic pleiotropy\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-twiv-离最近诊所每多开一小时车-疫情被发现的概率就降32/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"https://www.microbe.tv/wp-content/uploads/2018/09/TWiV_v3_white.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:53:39</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">This Week in Virology</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>离最近诊所每多开一小时车，疫情被发现的概率就降32%</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">横跨58,319起疫情、169个国家的分析发现，到最近诊所的车程每增加一小时，疫情被发现并控制的概率就下降32%,比任何单一生态因素的影响都更稳定重复。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">人畜共患病</span><span class=\"tag\">疫情监测</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"Prehistoric Penguins Zealandia Waimanu pelagornithids Gastornis\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-04-ancients-企鹅比鲸鱼更早称霸南大洋-曾有大猩猩那么大/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/3a4aceaa18f618b9-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">40:51</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">The Ancients</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1004</span></div>\n<h2>企鹅比鲸鱼更早称霸南大洋，曾有大猩猩那么大</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">小行星灭绝恐龙后，企鹅抢在鲸鱼和鲨鱼之前登上南大洋食物链顶端，称霸约一千万年后才退位，变成今天这种讨喜的小个子。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">古生物学</span><span class=\"tag\">企鹅</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"One Brain, Any Body: Google DeepMind&#x27;s Keerthana on Gemini Robotics 2, Cross-Embodiment &amp; Humanoids VLA (vision-language-action model) cross-embodiment in-context learning / video prompting whole-body control UMI (Universal Manipulation Interface) e-stop\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-cogrev-机器人大脑仍是-gpt-2-换个身体-同一套模型就不会干活/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/d4ae49bc11b3d1d8-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:32:08</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">Cognitive Revolution</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>机器人大脑仍是 GPT-2:换个身体，同一套模型就不会干活</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">DeepMind机器人负责人说，机器人至今还没有GPT-3时刻，不是因为听不懂指令，而是同一套策略换一个机身就可能完全失灵，跟GPT在任何电脑上表现一致完全不同。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">具身智能</span><span class=\"tag\">人形机器人</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"hist\" data-hay=\"SYMHC Classics: Charles Colchester jugglery billet prestidigitator\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-stuffmissed-灵媒讹诈林肯夫人未遂-法庭最终只肯判他是-变戏法的/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/88586eb98e196b1a-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"S\"><span class=\"dur\">33:49</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"hist\"><span class=\"src\">Stuff You Missed in History Class</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>灵媒讹诈林肯夫人未遂，法庭最终只肯判他是「变戏法的」</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">法庭开庭前就言明：这场审判不是要证明灵媒真假，只是要确认柯尔切斯特有没有未经许可卖戏法逃税——这招后来让整个灵媒圈都紧张了。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>6</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">灵媒骗局</span><span class=\"tag\">林肯</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Galen Druke on the Midterms generic ballot wins above replacement blue dog Democrat DSA dummander\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-goodfight-选民讨厌民主党-不是因为它太左-而是因为它输了/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/c75b9a8ba0dff85c-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">The Good Fight</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>选民讨厌民主党，不是因为它太左，而是因为它输了</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">民主党支持率已经低到和特朗普打平，但民调里说它「不够左」的选民只有个位数——真正的愤怒来自输给了特朗普，以及中间选民觉得这个党不在为普通人说话。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">中期选举</span><span class=\"tag\">参议院</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"biz\" data-core=\"1\" data-hay=\"Beyond the God Model | Alex Atallah &amp; Amjad Masad neurodiversity decision model fusion model sandbagging\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-a16z-大模型公司把全球gdp当成自己的潜在市场/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7b2f032532c3a865-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">48:18</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"biz\"><span class=\"src\">a16z</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>大模型公司把全球GDP当成自己的潜在市场</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">大模型实验室谈融资时对标的是整个世界GDP而非同行，这正是企业要自建AI能力、不把核心业务全押给一家模型公司的根本原因——Figma和Harvey是先例。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">多模型路由</span><span class=\"tag\">企业AI战略</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ai\" data-hay=\"20VC: The Future of Datacentres: What You Need to Know | Why Everyone Gets GPU Depreciation and AI&#x27;s Energy Costs Wrong | Who Really Makes Money From AI &amp; Why Most Moats Don&#x27;t Exist with Chase Lochmiller KV cache take or pay idiot index RDMA fabric\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-twentyvc-数据中心推高电价是误解-数据显示周边电价反而下降/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/7afaaa395482e96d-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"T\"><span class=\"dur\">1:01:15</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ai\"><span class=\"src\">20VC</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>数据中心推高电价是误解：数据显示周边电价反而下降</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">Crusoe创始人用数据反驳：数据中心建设会催生新发电产能，把更多兆瓦摊薄在同一套输配电网络上，社区电价因此下降而非上涨。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">数据中心</span><span class=\"tag\">算力</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"sci\" data-hay=\"Relational Psychology (BONDING VIA LAUGHING) with Sara Algoe and Laura Kurtz benign violation hypothesis inclusion of other in the self Golden Fleece Award\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-ologies-决定关系好坏的不是笑话好不好笑-而是你们有没有一起笑/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/6714d8dbd3a57d1f-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"O\"><span class=\"dur\">52:59</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"sci\"><span class=\"src\">Ologies</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>决定关系好坏的不是笑话好不好笑，而是你们有没有一起笑</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">研究发现：让陌生人同步大笑的信号，比内容是否好笑本身更能预测两人会不会愿意继续交往，哪怕全程没有交谈，也能起效。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">关系心理学</span><span class=\"tag\">笑声与亲密感</span>\n</div></div></a>", "<a class=\"card\" data-card data-cat=\"ideas\" data-hay=\"HoP 500c Troels Engberg-Pedersen on St Paul and the Stoics paronesis adiaphora pneuma akrasia politeuma eudaimonia\" href=\"/podcast/p/2026-10-03-hopwag-保罗说的-灵-是斯多葛式的物质-不是柏拉图式的虚无/\">\n<div class=\"cover\"><img src=\"/podcast/assets/cover/ec115ed691f40c47-c.jpg\" alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" data-initial=\"H\"><span class=\"dur\">41:28</span></div>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<div class=\"kicker\" data-cat=\"ideas\"><span class=\"src\">History of Philosophy Without Any Gaps</span>\n<span class=\"date\">1003</span></div>\n<h2>保罗说的「灵」是斯多葛式的物质，不是柏拉图式的虚无</h2>\n<p class=\"dek\">保罗本人从未区分物质世界与非物质的「灵」，这个二分是基督教后来被柏拉图主义接管之后才强加上去的，在保罗和斯多葛哲学里「灵」都是实在的物质。</p>\n<div class=\"card-foot\">\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>8</b> 要点</span>\n<span class=\"badge\"><b>7</b> 金句</span>\n<span class=\"tag\">早期基督教</span><span class=\"tag\">斯多葛主义</span>\n</div></div></a>"]